<title>UK: LIFFE COFFEE ENDS MIXED, COCOA, SUGAR FIRMER.</title>
<headline>LIFFE COFFEE ENDS MIXED, COCOA, SUGAR FIRMER.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Ends tightly mixed after Sept/Nov gyrations, spurns NY rally. Sept down $1 at $1,644.</p>
<p>COCOA - Firmer at close after trade buying interest but volume remains thin.</p>
<p>Sept up 10 at 1,011 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Trade arbitrage selling dominates as October whites recover ground lost earlier. Up 80 cents at $325.50 at 1604 GMT.</p>
</text>
